  "body": "### Summary\n\nMigration lot LOT-048 (Phase 3 — engine / Flows (`HFRClient`) — fetch → parse → submit → classify ([ADR 0008](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/adr/0008-hfrclient-orchestration-module.md))): Post-form engine: reply, edit, delete (incl. first post = whole topic), new topic, new MP, MP reply — posts as the **selected** account (Q-8); `verifrequet`, browser checkbox semantics, refuses non-BMP characters (Q-3), per-flow success markers, never reports success unless HFR confirmed it.\n\n### Scope\n\nPost-form engine: reply, edit, delete (incl. first post = whole topic), new topic, new MP, MP reply — posts as the **selected** account (Q-8); `verifrequet`, browser checkbox semantics, refuses non-BMP characters (Q-3), per-flow success markers, never reports success unless HFR confirmed it\n\n- Module: HFRClient · Difficulty: difficult · Priority: medium\n- Audit source: D3\n\n### Depends on\n\nLOT-036 (#63), LOT-037 (#64), LOT-042 (#68)\n\n### Model\n\nOpus → Fable\n\n### Spec\n\nNo spec file on `dev-swift` yet (`docs/lots/LOT-048-*.md`).\n\n### PRs\n\n- [ezzz/HFRnow#36](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/pull/36) — LOT-048: post-form engine (reply, edit, delete, new topic, MP) (open; work)\n- [ezzz/HFRnow#34](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/pull/34) — chore(lots): claim wave 3 (LOT-048, 047) (merged; claim/bookkeeping)\n\n### Old issue (frozen)\n\n[francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR#76](https://github.com/francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR/issues/76) — read-only history.\n\n### Owner / session\n\n`mac/w3-048-opus` since 2026-10-27\n\n### Pending captures\n\n- CAP-edit-form-of-an-own-message (#128)\n\n(Rows of the Mac capture backlog that name this lot.)\n\n### Status note\n\n`docs/LOTS.md` status cell on 2026-10-27: `in-progress`.\n",
